    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b18afc2f_24663edc",
        "filename": "microdroid_manager/src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 213,
      "author": {
        "id": 1139038
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-18T17:23:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does the bootconfig get interpreted by microdroid_manager? Or is it used by u-boot and microdroid_manager then uses the system properties that it creates?\n\nIIUC, the config file is part of the APK so it should already covered by `verified_data.apk_data.root_hash`?",
      "parentUuid": "5b985d05_be5ededc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 78,
        "endLine": 213,
        "endChar": 110
      },
      "revId": "04f232aadcc51677aeceefa549d69d32d5b1718c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d788833a_655b7a6b",
        "filename": "microdroid_manager/src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 213,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-18T17:45:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Microdroid_manager doesn\u0027t parse bootconfig. It\u0027s done by the kernel and the init. Microdroid_manager only cares about whether it has changed or not.\n\nconfig file is part of the APK, but there could be multiple config files in the APK. So, yeah, I was wrong in saying that we need hash of the config file; we don\u0027t need that though it wouldn\u0027t be harmful. We at least need the path for the config file.",
      "parentUuid": "b18afc2f_24663edc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 78,
        "endLine": 213,
        "endChar": 110
      },
      "revId": "04f232aadcc51677aeceefa549d69d32d5b1718c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c8b461b7_0c93f9f4",
        "filename": "microdroid_manager/src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 213,
      "author": {
        "id": 1139038
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-18T18:19:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s sounding like the bootconfig should be captured by u-boot instead, especially as it affects things that happen before microdroid_manager loads anything.\n\nAnd the config file path comes from the payload-metadata partition which currently has a single field: the config path. I see.",
      "parentUuid": "d788833a_655b7a6b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 78,
        "endLine": 213,
        "endChar": 110
      },
      "revId": "04f232aadcc51677aeceefa549d69d32d5b1718c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
